<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Silicon Graphics.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill cuts Silicon Graphics.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch cut Silicon Graphics Inc to a near-term neutral from its prior rating of near-term accumulate, and cut the stock to a long-term accumulate from its prior rating of long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed at 21-1/2 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- After the market close Thursday, the company posted a net loss after special charges of $22 million.</p>
</text>
